                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Donald Trump claims that he has the authority to create a $100 billion dollar hole in not only in the budget of New York, but in the lives of millions of New Yorkers who depend on essential government programs for their health and safety.\n\nI believe in the importance of safeguarding federally funded programs from falling victim to Donald Trump\u2019s unchecked defunding efforts\u2014for the well-being of New Yorkers, and Americans at large.",
