                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "In my district, 495,539 people on Medicaid are at risk of losing their health care under the Republican budget plans.\n\nThis includes 186,376 children under the age of 19 and 53,000 seniors over 65.\n\nThis is unconscionable.",
