                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Despite my repeated pleas and multiple announcements of multi-agency operations\u2014often launched with great fanfare\u2014the City is no closer to solving the public health and safety crisis that has taken hold of the South Bronx's Hub.\n\nThe City must demonstrate a renewed whole-of-government commitment to reclaiming the Hub from the grip of drug trafficking and return it where it rightfully belongs: to the people of the Bronx.",
