                "text": "\ud83c\udfa5 WATCH NOW to see exactly what is at stake with the proposed Medicare home health cuts coming out of Washington, DC.\n\nIn the Bronx, where so many seniors and families rely on home health care to live with dignity, these cuts could be a crushing blow to our community. We CANNOT let them stand.",
